Package: vireo
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Description: Clean, fast GNOME-native email client
 Vireo is a desktop email client for Wayland that feels at home in
 GNOME. It talks IMAP and SMTP directly, keeps your mail and
 credentials on your machine, and blocks trackers by default - no
 telemetry, no analytics.
